on entrepreneurship, read these 10 articles by experts in the field. We've combed through hundreds of articles in the Harvard Business Review archive and selected the most important ones to help you build your company for enduring success. Leading experts and practitioners such as Clayton Christensen, Marc Andreessen, Steve Blank, and Reid Hoffman provide the insights and advice you need to: Build a business from the ground up Adopt lean startup practices like business model experimentation Be realistic about how prescient your business plan can truly be Focus on the most important part of your business: the people Connect powerfully with your audience of investors and customers - Understand where companies with the most impact are launching nowcProvided by publisher  aBusinesspeople.  aEntrepreneurship.  aNew business enterprises.00873nam a2200217 a 45000010006000000050010000060400011000160410008000270820014000350840011000490900021000601000018000812450260000992600088003593000046004476500021004936500025005146500036005397000056005757000024006315229618/8/2020  aDHSPKT  aVie  223a006.7  aCTT-10  a006.7bN569-T883  aNgô Văn Tú  aXây dựng Website bán hàng thời trang sử dụng công nghệ ASP. Net core:bĐồ án tốt nghiệp Khoa Chất lượng cao ngành Công nghệ thông tin/cNgô Văn Tú, Phạm Xuân Khiêm; Nguyễn Minh Đạo (Giảng viên hướng dẫn)  aTp. Hồ Chí Minh:bĐại học Sư phạm Kỹ thuật Tp. Hồ Chí Minh,c2020  axv; 107tr: minh họa;c30cm + 1 đĩa CD  aỨng dụng web  aThiết kế website  aWebsite bán hàng thời trang  aNguyễn Minh Đạo,eGiảng viên hướng dẫn  aPhạm Xuân Khiêm00651nam a2200217 a 45000010006000000050011000060200018000170400011000350410008000460820016000540900018000701000023000882450124001112600035002353000025002706500026002956500040003216500026003617000023003877000023004104390522/12/2017  a9781119080701  aDHSPKT  aEng  a620.106223  a620.106bG368  aGerhart, Philip M.  aMunson, Young, and Okiishi's fundamentals of fluid mechanics /cPhilip M. Gerhart, Andrew L. Gerhart, John I. Hochstein  aHoboken, N. J. :bWiley,c2016  axxii, 777p. ;c28 cm  aDynamique des fluides  aElectric motorsvElectronic control  aMecanique des fluides  aGerhart, Andrew L.  aHochstein, John I.00459nam a2200193 a 4500001000500000005001000005020001700015040001100032041000800043082001600051090001800067094000900085100002300094245003900117260004400156300001700200650002800217650002000245726822/5/2003  a0 07 11349 2  aDHSPKT  aEng  223a620.106  a620.106bL723  aC253  aLiggestt, James A.  aFluid mechanics/cJames A.Liggestt  aNew York: ,bMcGraw - Hill, Inc.,c1994  a495p.;c24cm  aCơ học chất lỏng  aFluid mechanics01602nam a2200229 a 450000100050000000500090000502000180001404000110003204100080004308200160005109000180006709400090008510000190009424500630011325000130017626000430018930000190023252009170025152001430116865000410131165000200135281504/9/2002  a0 07 460369 8  aDHSPKT  aEng  a620.106223  a620.106bS941  aC2531#aSubramanya, K.  aTheory and applications of fluid mechanics/cK. Subramanya  a10th ed.  aNew Delhi:bMcGraw-Hill Offices,c2003  a752p.;c25cm..  aThis book is designed, primarily for the benefit of undergraduate engineering students, as an essential supplement to any text in fluid mechanics. The topics normally dealt with at the core and professional levels are covered in 16 chapters. In each of the chapters, an outline of the basic theory is given which is followed by a large number of carefully chosen worked examples covering all the sub areas of the chapter theme. A set of problems with answers is provided in each chapter to enable the students to have the requisite follow-up practice. Further, a set of objective questiong with answres, provided at the end of each chapter, helps the students not only in understanding the concepts but also aids in quick review of the material. The contents of each chapter have been designed to help the user in learnig all its aspects viz., theory, application, information manipulation, and processing skill.  aTechaers will find this book beneficial as source-material for well-palntned and interesting problems, as well as for objective questions.  aCơ học chất lỏng ứng dụng  aFluid mechanics00607nam a2200205 a 45000010006000000050010000060200018000160400011000340410008000450820016000530900018000691000023000872450087001102600043001973000044002405000051002846500020003357000023003557000023003785179219/5/2020  a9781119248989  aDHSPKT  aEng  a620.106223  a620.106bG368  aGerhart, Philip M.  aMunson's fluid mechanics/cPhilip M. Gerhart, Andrew L. Gerhart, John I. Hochstein  aSingapore:bJohn Wiley & Sons,c[2017]  axxii, 678 pages : illustrations;c28 cm  aIncludes bibliographical references and index.  aFluid mechanics  aGerhart, Andrew L.  aHochstein, John I.00769nam a2200193 a 4500001000600000005000900006040001100015041000800026082001700034084001100051090002500062100002300087245022500110260008800335300004900423650002100472650002800493700005400521524033/9/2020  aDHSPKT  aVie  223a690.8314  aXDC-49  a690.8314bĐ182-A596  aĐặng Quốc Anh  aChung cư cao cấp Libery:bĐồ án tốt nghiệp Khoa đào tạo chất lượng cao ngành Công nghệ kỹ thuật công trình xây dựng/cĐặng Quốc Anh; Nguyễn Văn Khoa (Giảng viên hướng dẫn)  aTp. Hồ Chí Minh:bĐại học Sư phạm Kỹ thuật Tp. Hồ Chí Minh,c2020  aviii, 328tr.: minh họa;c30cm + 1 đĩa CD  aChung cư Libery  aChung cưvThiết kế  aNguyễn Văn Khoa,eGiảng viên hướng dẫn00784nam a2200193 a 4500001000600000005000900006040001100015041000800026082001700034084001100051090002400062100003200086245023800118260008800356300004500444650001700489650002800506700005600534524053/9/2020  aDHSPKT  aVie  223a690.8314  aXDC-49  a690.8314bN573-T562  aNguyễn Đặng Sĩ Tiến  aChung cư bến Bình Đông:bĐồ án tốt nghiệp Khoa đào tạo chất lượng cao ngành Công nghệ kỹ thuật côn